                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <ul class=" p-0">
                            <li class="litext">
                                Certainly! Analyzing a call transcript typically involves reviewing the conversation between individuals during a phone call or any other communication medium, extracting key information, identifying patterns, sentiment analysis, and drawing insights from the dialogue.
                            </li>

                        </ul>
                        <img src="~/content/assets/images/screen/callTranscript.png" class="img-fluid mb-2 shadow-sm border tile_img" alt="" />
                        <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between;">
